{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02407",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.97,
      "end_seconds": 7.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "Doctor, this one's ready for you. Everything's on the chart, but I'll go through it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.47,
      "end_seconds": 12.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Okay, thanks. Hi, how can I help today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 14.15,
      "end_seconds": 25.36,
      "duration_seconds": 11.21,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay. It's no symptoms, doctor. He didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.34,
      "end_seconds": 28.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.11,
      "end_seconds": 42.4,
      "duration_seconds": 12.29,
      "text": "Ever since... since last Tuesday, really. I've never really been one for hospitals. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.24,
      "end_seconds": 47.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.24,
      "end_seconds": 72.7,
      "duration_seconds": 24.46,
      "text": "It feels severe to me. Oh, and being a little overweight. Had that since last night. Oh, and a high blood sugar on a routine test. That's been about the same, two months. With high blood sugar on a routine test, I'd give it a seven, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.54,
      "end_seconds": 77.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "And what about frequent urination or blurred vision?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.27,
      "end_seconds": 82.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "No, you know, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.66,
      "end_seconds": 87.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Have you noticed weight loss or thirst?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.29,
      "end_seconds": 92.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "No weight loss or thirst, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.47,
      "end_seconds": 96.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.53,
      "end_seconds": 99.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.49,
      "end_seconds": 105.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Okay, what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.91,
      "end_seconds": 113.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Bisoprolol, 2.5 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 115.15,
      "end_seconds": 125.89,
      "duration_seconds": 10.74,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the bisoprolol was 5 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.44,
      "end_seconds": 132.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Okay. Have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.39,
      "end_seconds": 140.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Oh, no, I left it at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.83,
      "end_seconds": 148.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.05,
      "end_seconds": 162.19,
      "duration_seconds": 13.14,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.5,
      "end_seconds": 164.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.23,
      "end_seconds": 168.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.9,
      "end_seconds": 173.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.22,
      "end_seconds": 184.29,
      "duration_seconds": 9.07,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. I swim twice a week. My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.93,
      "end_seconds": 188.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.01,
      "end_seconds": 209.27,
      "duration_seconds": 19.26,
      "text": "I've got eczema. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. I didn't want to make a fuss, uh, you know. I have an irregular heartbeat, for two years. Migraines, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.92,
      "end_seconds": 216.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Right, right. Okay, I can see eczema in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 228.79,
      "end_seconds": 240.2,
      "duration_seconds": 11.41,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Height 158 centimetres, weight 98 kilos, SpO2 99 percent on room air. Pulse 72, respiratory rate 14, blood pressure 114 over 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.45,
      "end_seconds": 242.15,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.03,
      "end_seconds": 249.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.61,
      "end_seconds": 267.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.85,
      "end_seconds": 271.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.42,
      "end_seconds": 293.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Your blood pressure and heart rate are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.66,
      "end_seconds": 300.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.76,
      "end_seconds": 317.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like prediabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 319.54,
      "end_seconds": 321.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.85,
      "end_seconds": 345.03,
      "duration_seconds": 23.18,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now prediabetes is my leading thought, not anything worse. I'm going to order a repeat HbA1c, for prediabetes. Walk thirty minutes daily, cut sugary drinks and aim to lose five percent of your weight. We'll refer you to the diabetes prevention programme."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 345.74,
      "end_seconds": 349.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "So, sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.49,
      "end_seconds": 366.37,
      "duration_seconds": 15.88,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. I'd like you back in six months. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.15,
      "end_seconds": 371.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.67,
      "end_seconds": 373.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}